=== Edit on main in the primary checkout (origin/HEAD)
exit 2
--- stderr
BLOCKED by bendit: this edit is in the primary checkout of <tmp>/proj, on `main`, the integration branch (origin/HEAD).
primary-checkout-guard is on in .claude/bendit.json: work in a worktree, so `main` changes only by merge.
Make one, then make this edit there:

    git -C <tmp>/proj worktree add <tmp>/proj-edit-app -b edit-app

The file is then <tmp>/proj-edit-app/app.py. (If that folder or branch already exists, pick another name.)
Turning the guard off is the person's call (/bendit:adopt --detailed), not yours.

